=== dira handoff, tier 2 ===

dira sniff staged 3 decisions. Tier 1 records no because, no alternative
and no edge (dec-0003):

  dec-0001  We settled on lexical matching in the binary…
  dec-0002  we're going with static HTML the user deploys…
  dec-0003  I'll hold the wave here rather than start…

If you can call tools, supply alternatives, why_not and derives_from
from what was actually said. Never invent one. One call per id:

  dira log --kind decision --state staged --tier semantic --hook PreCompact \
    --title '<one line>' --body '<the because, in the words used>' \
    --alternative '<the road not taken>' --why-not '<why it lost>' \
    --edge derives_from=dec-0001 --excerpt '<the sentence>'

If you cannot call tools, you are summarising for compaction: carry
this block into the summary unchanged. Nothing else carries the ids
across it (dec-0023).

